        },
        "202170002": {
          "id": 202170002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "名為「昔漣」的少女，怎麼會輕易離開呢～",
          "next": [
            202170003
          ]
        },
        "202170003": {
          "id": 202170003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "今天也是美好的一天。當然，要有鮮花的點綴♪",
          "next": [
            202170004
          ]
        },
        "202170004": {
          "id": 202170004,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "next": [
            202170005
          ]
        },
        "202170005": {
          "id": 202170005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "欸～挑選花束的時候我想了超久",
          "next": [
            202170006
          ]
        },
        "202170006": {
          "id": 202170006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "七彩的水晶玫瑰，從一粒種子開始，由人家親手培育而成～",
          "next": [
            202170007
          ]
        },
        "202170007": {
          "id": 202170007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "嘻～還有遐蝶花園裡的安提靈花，每一瓣都沾著露水",
          "next": [
            202170008
          ]
        },
        "202170008": {
          "id": 202170008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "向日葵與風鈴草，來自風堇的庭院，就像溫和的陽光～",
          "next": [
            202170009
          ]
        },
        "202170009": {
          "id": 202170009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "還有月光藍百合、滿天星、白桔梗……",
          "next": [
            202170010
          ]
        },
        "202170010": {
          "id": 202170010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "嘻～你猜…人家心中最滿意的搭配是什麼？",
          "next": [
            202170011
          ]
        },
        "202170011": {
          "id": 202170011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "鐺鐺，一束哀麗秘榭的麥穗！",
          "next": [
            202170012
          ]
        },
        "202170012": {
          "id": 202170012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "{NICKNAME}收到時，記得要閉上雙眼，麥香會帶你回到那片小村莊",
          "next": [
            202170013
          ]
        },
        "202170013": {
          "id": 202170013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "就像我們那時在鞦韆上高高蕩起，遠方的潮水拍打著岸，麥浪在腳下翻湧…",
          "next": [
            202170014
          ]
        },
        "202170014": {
          "id": 202170014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "更多的驚喜，就留給{NICKNAME}自己去發現啦",
          "next": [
            202170015
          ]
        },
        "202170015": {
          "id": 202170015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "即便人家不能一起，也要仔細閱讀卡片上的心意喲？",
          "next": [
            202170016
          ]
        },
        "202170016": {
          "id": 202170016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "希望{NICKNAME}的每一天，都有鮮花的陪伴呀♪",
          "next": [
            202170017,
            202170018,
            202170019
          ]
        },
        "202170017": {
          "id": 202170017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "謝謝你，昔漣",
